<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Your DOJU Order Has Shipped</title>
    <style>
      body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f5f5f5; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; }
      .container { width: 100%; max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); }
      .header { background: #a9f334; padding: 40px 20px; text-align: center; color: #ffffff; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
      .content { padding: 40px 30px; color: #333333; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; }
      .highlight { background: #f7f7f7; border-left: 4px solid #a9f334; padding: 16px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 24px 0; color: #444; }
      .details { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 20px 0 28px; }
      .details td { padding: 10px 0; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; font-size: 14px; }
      .details td:first-child { color: #666666; width: 42%; padding-right: 16px; }
      .button { display: inline-block; background: #a9f334; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 22px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; }
      .footer { background: #f7f7f7; text-align: center; padding: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #666666; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header"><h1>Your Order Has Shipped</h1></div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi {{ buyerName }},</p>
        <p>Good news! Your DOJU order is on its way.</p>
        <div class="highlight">
          <strong>Shipment summary</strong>
          <table class="details">
            <tr><td>Order ID</td><td>{{ orderId }}</td></tr>
            {% for item in items %}
            <tr><td>Product</td><td>{{ item.productName }}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Quantity</td><td>{{ item.quantity }}</td></tr>
            {% endfor %}
           <tr><td>Pickup store </td><td>{{ pickupStore }}</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Shipped at </td><td>{{ shippedAt }}</td></tr>
          </table>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align: center;"><a class="button" href="{{ trackingUrl }}">Track My Order</a></p>
        <p>Best regards,<br />The DOJU Team</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">You are receiving this email because your DOJU order has shipped.<br /><br />(c) 2026 DOJU</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>